              "text": "кандидат (kandidát) — \"a candidate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "На эту должность пять кандидатов. Na étu dólzhnost pyat kandidátov. There are five candidates for this post."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Кандидат наук is also a Russian academic degree, close to a doctorate."
            }
          ]
        },
